    "summary": "As your [Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase) finishes, the Techmarine can pick one **ADEPTUS ASTARTES VEHICLE** model from your army 3″ away or closer. It heals D3 wounds. The same model can disregard any modifiers on **[Hit rolls](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls)** or **[Wound rolls](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls)**. This ends when your next [Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase) begins.",
